 day. One road. Every flower in bloom.', description: 'An arcade road racer across the island of Bellafiore: drift, slipstream and pick your forks coast to coast before sunset, while your passenger asks for balloons, photos and danger.', type: 'Game', genre: 'Racing', source: 'OutRun 2006: Coast 2 Coast', series: 'OutRun', players: '1–4',\n      controls: 'Steer: stick/←→/A D · Gas: R2/✕/W · Brake: L2/□/S · Drift: ○/Space · Pause: Options/Esc', tags: ['arcade', 'vehicles', 'pixel art', 'retro', 'comedy', 'versus'] }\n  }\n};\n})();\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SRnndTzpoXeKrcVPtGvuD2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
