OF\ntimeout 600 node tests/run.mjs --only screens 2>&1 | tail -8","description":"Write and run the screenshots suite"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01HebHKhHEabTWZHenq2zxSf":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-035148__xe1b7e1/work/OutBloom2006Coast2Coast-OutRun2006Coast2Coast-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-035148"}}}
